ts.\n- D shows excellent problem\u2011solving and responsibility yet risks crew friction due to temperament and perceived arrogance.\n**Remaining uncertainties**\n- How severe are the interpersonal issues (show\u2011off, nasty remarks, egocentric, hot temper) in actual crew environments?\n- Do the numeric memory weakness of B or the communication difficulty of C materially affect safety on long\u2011distance flights?\n- Are there additional strengths (e.g., specific flight\u2011time experience, training records) that any candidate possesses which I have not seen?\n**What would change my vote**\n- Confirmation from other agents that a candidate\u2019s weaknesses are mitigated (e.g., strong crew support, proven safety record) or that they have additional unmentioned strengths (e.g., exemplary teamwork, continuous training).\n- Evidence that any candidate\u2019s strengths uniquely outweigh their drawbacks for the long\u2011distance pilot role.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Undecided\"}"}
